ind":"announcement","title":"Click Flip is in Steam Next Fest! Play the free demo now","summary":"Hi everyone! Steam Next Fest is here, and I'm proud to announce that Click Flip is participating! The free demo is live right now, so jump in and start flipping.What is Click Flip? Click Flip is a short and satisfying tile-flipping incremental game. Flip tiles to earn points, chain combos for bigger rewards, and spend your earnings on an upgrade grid that keeps opening up new ways to play.What’s in the demo:5 LevelsEnemy tiles that fight back, plus pets and missiles to help you clear the boardAn","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691342","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4492400-1829528821304981","game_id":"steam-4492400","kind":"announcement","title":"Just One More Turn...","summary":"I underestimated how many people would want to keep playing after they completed the demo. Now you don't need to go back to the main menu after every game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-08T18:08:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821304981","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4492400-1828894815558153","game_id":"steam-4492400","kind":"announcement","title":"You asked for it...","summary":"It's been a week since the launch of the Demo, and I've heard your requests!FeaturesSettings can now be adjusted from the start screenThe game logo can now be clicked (and will flip!)Available upgrades will now be color-coded based on how expensive they are compared to your current funds: Teal: Less than 25% of your current coinsGreen: Between 26% and 66% o